WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:08.494
"Wow! Your birthday cake is beautiful," said Bob.

2
00:00:08.495 --> 00:00:12.018
"It has so many layers!

3
00:00:12.019 --> 00:00:14.459
Who made it?"

4
00:00:14.460 --> 00:00:18.425
"Well," I said.

5
00:00:18.426 --> 00:00:21.377
"A farmer grew the wheat.

6
00:00:21.378 --> 00:00:27.205
A miller changed the wheat into flour.

7
00:00:27.206 --> 00:00:31.395
A chicken laid the eggs.

8
00:00:31.396 --> 00:00:34.333
And a cow gave the milk.

9
00:00:34.334 --> 00:00:38.330
So they helped make my cake.

10
00:00:38.331 --> 00:00:43.949
A truck driver delivered the flour, eggs, and milk.

11
00:00:43.950 --> 00:00:49.741
A clerk sold them to my mother.

12
00:00:49.742 --> 00:00:53.513
My mother brought them home.

13
00:00:53.514 --> 00:00:56.989
So they helped too.

14
00:00:56.990 --> 00:01:09.418
My grandmother put everything into a bowl.

15
00:01:09.419 --> 00:01:12.911
She mixed the flour, eggs, and milk.

16
00:01:12.912 --> 00:01:16.333
Then she poured it into a baking pan.

17
00:01:16.334 --> 00:01:20.576
My sister put the pan into the oven.

18
00:01:20.577 --> 00:01:25.194
After thirty minutes she took it out.

19
00:01:25.195 --> 00:01:29.318
So they also helped.

20
00:01:29.319 --> 00:01:32.297
Then I put the icing on the cake.

21
00:01:32.298 --> 00:01:35.800
So I helped too.

22
00:01:35.801 --> 00:01:40.888
We all helped make it.

23
00:01:40.889 --> 00:01:43.711
"Wow!" said Bob.

24
00:01:43.712 --> 00:01:47.126
"Many people helped make your cake.

25
00:01:47.127 --> 00:01:50.346
But it's not finished yet!"

26
00:01:50.347 --> 00:01:53.165
"What do you mean?" I asked.

27
00:01:53.166 --> 00:01:56.241
"It looks finished to me."

28
00:01:56.242 --> 00:02:00.497
"It doesn't have candles!" said Bob.

29
00:02:00.498 --> 00:02:02.150
"I'll put some on.

30
00:02:02.151 --> 00:02:08.196
I helped too!

31
00:02:08.197 --> 00:02:15.987
Happy Birthday!"

